    "description": "How this build reached the reader. Three facts in one line, because a reader who installed a file by hand needs to know that is normal."
  },
  "@aboutCopyVersion": {
    "description": "The clipboard button. C9 says the owner must be able to determine which version is installed, and pasting a version into a bug report is how that happens."
  },
  "@aboutVersionUnreadable": {
    "description": "A real failure mode: the defines are absent in a plain `flutter test` and in an IDE run. **The rest of the screen renders completely** — `Version —` is forbidden, because an em dash looks like a version and C9 requires the version to be determinable."
  },
