  "@settingsRowHistoryValue": {
    "description": "`{count}` and `{relative}`. ⚠️ **Never a zero here** — `settingsRowHistoryValueEmpty` is a separate key, because `{count} entries · oldest {relative}` with a zero has no oldest to name.",
    "placeholders": {
